    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42289" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρ-εισις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>propping up, shoring up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					35.243
				</span></i>
			(Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>resting, supporting,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπ᾽ ἐδάφους ἔ. τοῦ ποδός</span>
			Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pushing against, thrusting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πέτρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χείλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					11.488e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>leverage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Menesth.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμβην.</span>
			</div>
